null},{"id":"event_darkhero_04_s_41","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_darkhero_04_s_41","text":"As Trony begins to step back, Ether raises both of her hands in the air.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_darkhero_04_s_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_darkhero_04_s_42","text":"Oh, don't misunderstand me.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_darkhero_04_s_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_darkhero_04_s_43","text":"I didn't come here to take you in. Quite the opposite, actually.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_darkhero_04_s_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_darkhero_04_s_44","text":"I came here to give you a chance.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_darkhero_04_s_45","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_darkhero_04_s_45","text":"Ether approaches Trony with an equivocal smile.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_darkhero_04_s_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_darkhero_04_s_46","text":"You have two options:","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_darkhero_04_s_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_darkhero_04_s_47","text":"The first is to say that Elegg is the sole individual responsible for planning the attack